# Huzaifa Sa'ad — Portfolio

Personal portfolio site — plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, no build step.

**Live site:** https://houzsaad-portfolio.vercel.app/

## Sections

- **Profile** — name, role, social links, résumé download
- **Tech Stack** — languages, backend, frontend, and tools
- **Projects** — SMD (VTU Payment System), Student Resource Hub, Auction Marketplace API, Savewise
- **Contact** — email and social links

## Tech

- HTML5, CSS3 (custom properties for theming), vanilla JavaScript
- Dark/light mode toggle with `localStorage` persistence
- Deployed on [Vercel](https://vercel.com)

## Structure

```
portfolio/
  index.html
  style.css
  script.js
  resume.pdf
```